          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "T-S J1.4 , r, left [Col. I]",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Also dis[p]ensed for them</li>\n<li>on Friday the 14th</li>\n<li>of <i>Marheshvan</i> five qin\u1e6d\u0101rs (500 pounds)</li>\n<li>the supervisor of milk and his in-law 4 the wife of the man from Sicily</li>\n<li>Aharon and his wife 2 b. al-Kharaz\u012b (the son of the maker of beads) 1</li>\n<li>the son of the afflicted man 1 the female washer of the dead for Fustat 1</li>\n<li>Sam\u012b\u1e25 the Kohen 3 Makhl\u016bf the blind man 2</li>\n<li>the wife of the tanner 2 Ab\u016b Sa\u02bf\u012bd the blind man 3</li>\n<li>Sib\u0101\u02bf 3 Umm Furayj 1</li>\n<li>the divorc&eacute;e of B\u016b Sa\u02bf\u012bd 3 Umm Hill\u0101la 1</li>\n<li>Zuhayr 4 <del>3</del> Bark\u0101t the supervisor 3</li>\n<li>the <i>cantor</i> Sa\u02bfadya 2 Umm Ibrahim 2</li>\n<li>Umm S\u0101lim 2 Avraham of Tyre 3</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfaqov the blind man 2 an orphan from Andalusia 2</li>\n<li>Umm Khal\u012bf 2 Yosef the night watchman 5</li>\n<li>\u1e62\u0101li\u1e25 4 Ab\u016b Khal\u012bf the blind man 3</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Khal\u012bfa 4 Furayj the man with tremors 3</li>\n<li>Barak\u0101t the glassmaker 2 Sulaym\u0101n the supervisor 2</li>\n<li>the man from the Hij\u0101z 2 mother of the blind person 2</li>\n<li>the wife of the seller of fuqq\u0101\u02bf (honey sherbet) 2 the mother-in-law of Mu\u1e6d\u0101lib\u012b 2</li>\n<li>the wife of the man from Qalah\u0101 3 b. Dani\u02beel 6</li>\n<li>b. al-Munajjim (son of the astrologer) and his brother 6 the son of al-\u02bfAmm\u0101ni 3</li>\n<li>al-J\u0101zif\u012bn\u012b 10 the man from Mal\u012bj 5</li>\n<li>Salm\u0101n 6 the daughter of \u1e24as\u012bka 3</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Mukht\u0101r 7 the mother-in-law of Mukht\u0101r 2</li>\n<li>Hil\u0101l 2 Umm Sham\u02bfa 4</li>\n<li>the acquaintance of Abu\u02bel-Mun\u0101 3 the acquaintance of b. \u1e6c\u012bb\u0101n 3</li>\n<li>the man from Ba\u02bfalbek 5 the wife of Ma\u02bfl\u0101\u02be 4</li>\n<li>Umm \u1e92arifa 2 Sal\u0101ma 3</li>\n<li>b. al-\u1e24il\u0101l 8 the \u1e25aver R. Shelomo 6</li>\n<li>165</li></ol>\n",
